    { "_comment": "Templates 01-10 also ship a stray un-rigged copy of the body plus baked hair/beard meshes outside the armature; 11-20 are clean single-armature bodies. Only pick from 11-20.",
      "_clipsNote": "The bodies ship 30 clips (00_TPose..29_Dance_5_Cabbage_Patch) and the keyframes are most of the file, which put every one of them over twice PLAN.md's 300KB budget. A captain stands, walks, waves and celebrates; the rest are dance moves and combat swings nothing in this game asks for. Order matters — the first surviving clip is what instantiate() plays when no clip is named, so idle comes first. Naming a clip the model does not have fails the build rather than silently shipping without it. Leave `clips` off any model that needs all of its animations: the mobs and the ships do.",
      "clips": ["01_Idle_1", "04_Walk", "15_Waving_Right", "18_Success_Celebration"],
